{"unit_id":"siruignaw-sys__dsh-tool-bandit-search#card-zh","repo":"siruignaw-sys/dsh-tool-bandit-search","commit":"089dd0d3e5b2b1686e66363905b8a393caa1d387","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tool-bandit-search 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的搜索插件：它注册 search 工具，并通过系统提示引导模型使用该工具进行网页搜索。工具使用 Thompson sampling 在快速单查询和 thorough 多角度并行查询之间选择，根据结果数量与耗时计算奖励并更新两种策略的状态。快速策略最多返回五条结果；深入策略会生成三个查询角度、合并去重并最多保留十条结果。适合希望让网页搜索在速度与覆盖范围之间自适应取舍的 DSH 用户。它依赖 DSH 配置好的原生 web 搜索服务，不需要插件单独配置 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/bandit-search.ts:99-153"]}
{"unit_id":"siruignaw-sys__dsh-tool-bandit-search#card-en","repo":"siruignaw-sys/dsh-tool-bandit-search","commit":"089dd0d3e5b2b1686e66363905b8a393caa1d387","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-tool-bandit-search adds a DSH Web search tool. Thompson sampling selects a quick query or three parallel query angles, then updates strategy scores from result count and latency. It balances speed and coverage using DSH’s configured web search service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/bandit-search.ts:99-153"]}
